        "original_id": "39ac5e82-14bb-5740-816e-a054efb13ba7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Jacksonville Transportation Authority, Jacksonville International Airport\n- Places: Rosa Parks Transit Station, Downtown Jacksonville, Duval County, Florida, Jacksonville\n- Facilities: major bus terminal, intermodal transit station, civil-military public airport\n- Topics: public transit, airport location\n\nFacts:\n- The Rosa Parks Transit Station is an intermodal station in Jacksonville, Florida.\n- A major bus terminal at the Rosa Parks Transit Station serves as the Jacksonville Transportation Authority's main transit hub.\n- Jacksonville International Airport is a civil-military public airport.\n- Jacksonville International Airport has the codes IATA JAX, ICAO KJAX, and FAA LID JAX.\n- Jacksonville International Airport is located 13 miles north of Downtown Jacksonville in Duval County, Florida.",
